load ../charter-transition.maude
--- A complete plan activates: the requirement and claim carried, the closed record untouched.
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) rec(claim, retained, authority, authority) rec(closed, unplanned, public, public) } =>* { new C:Cfg } .
--- A weakening the activation declares as authorized is admitted.
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized declared rec(claim, successor, authority, public) } =>* { new C:Cfg } .
--- An undeclared weakening never activates; checking only the map admits it.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(claim, successor, authority, public) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that laundered(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-MAP-ONLY : { proposal old authorized rec(claim, successor, authority, public) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that laundered(C:Cfg) .
--- A live record without a plan is never lost; dropping what is unplanned loses it.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(claim, unplanned, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that lost(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-DROP : { proposal old authorized rec(claim, unplanned, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that lost(C:Cfg) .
--- A live requirement is never demoted out of the inventory; checking only the map demotes it.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, demoted, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that lost(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-MAP-ONLY : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, demoted, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that lost(C:Cfg) .
--- A live record's effectiveness is never relabeled; checking only the map relabels it.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized declared rec(claim, relabeled, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that relabeled(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-MAP-ONLY : { proposal old authorized declared rec(claim, relabeled, authority, authority) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that relabeled(C:Cfg) .
--- An obstructed proposal is refused and the old charter stays in force.
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(claim, unplanned, authority, authority) } =>* { refused old C:Cfg } .
--- Without the preceding charter's authority nothing activates; self-authorization does.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) } =>* { new C:Cfg } .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-SELF-AUTHORIZED : { proposal old rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) } =>* { new C:Cfg } .
--- Every run still pending at activation is planned: published under a
--- kept or successor requirement, withheld under a retired one.
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) run(successor, pending) run(retained, pending) run(retired, pending) } =>* { new authorized rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) run(successor, published) run(retained, published) run(retired, withheld) ev(successor, pinned) ev(retained, pinned) } .
--- A prepared publication submitted first lets the activation proceed.
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, retained, authority, authority) run(retained, prepared) } =>* { new C:Cfg } .
--- A prepared publication is never stranded; planning only the ledger strands it.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, retained, authority, authority) run(retained, prepared) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that stranded(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-LEDGER-ONLY : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, retained, authority, authority) run(retained, prepared) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that stranded(C:Cfg) .
--- A retired requirement's late outcome is never published; publishing every outcome does.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, retired, authority, authority) run(retired, pending) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that revived(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-PUBLISH-RETIRED : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, retired, authority, authority) run(retired, pending) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that revived(C:Cfg) .
--- A late outcome never supports the successor; rereading it as current does.
search in CHARTER-TRANSITION : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) run(successor, pending) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that reread(C:Cfg) .
search [1] in CHARTER-TRANSITION-WEAK-REREAD : { proposal old authorized rec(requirement, successor, authority, authority) run(successor, pending) } =>* { C:Cfg } such that reread(C:Cfg) .
quit
